    {
      "id": "claim_f10a34f4ea62425da9197a5d9d005074",
      "statement": "The Web UI performs an OAuth 2.0 authorization code flow by calling GET /auth with a static client ID configured in Dex, then exchanging the returned authorization code for a JWT and refresh token via POST /auth.",
